<title>UK: Goldman leads asset-backed bond for Citibank CCMT.</title>
<headline>Goldman leads asset-backed bond for Citibank CCMT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A two-tranche asset-backed dollar participation certificate has been launched for Citibank Credit Card Master Trust 1, series 97/4.</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS A</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	SPREAD     11.5 BP   EXP MAT     10.MAR.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  LEG MAT     10.MAR.11</p>
<p> FEES	 45 BP     ISS PRICE  99.95603  AVE LIFE    12 YEARS</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.95603  PAY DATE   L20.FEB.97</p>
<p> L-LONG FIRST COUPON TO 10.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>CLASS B  AMT    $48 MLN	 SPREAD     29 BP</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR</p>
<p>ISS PRICE  99.91292  REOFFER    99.91292</p>
<p> NOTES	CITIBANK IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7718</p>
</text>
